    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to CODEDOOR, a thrilling survival action experience set in a chilling, abandoned container yard overrun by relentless zombies. Each session throws you into an eerie industrial landscape scattered with locked containers, but only one matches the unique code you're given. Your objective is clear: hunt it down and unlock it to advance to the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with powerful weapons, including the precise M1911 and rapid-fire MAC-10, each delivering satisfying feedback with impactful visual effects and immersive sound design. Feel the intensity with every shot and elimination as you fend off waves of aggressive zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach Wave 10 and secure at least 30 kills to unlock the ultimate weapon... The Nuke. Pick it up, launch it, and celebrate a spectacular victory, bringing an explosive end to your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Container Hunt:</strong> Freshly generated codes and containers ensure random and endless replayability, ideal for speedrunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Combat:</strong> Satisfying weapon handling, impressive kill effects, and immersive audio feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Survival:</strong> Test your tactical thinking under constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environment:</strong> Detailed, atmospheric container yard designed to keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rare and Mysterious Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be alert! The abandoned yard holds secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you unlock the secrets and survive the CODEDOOR?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to CODEDOOR, a thrilling survival action experience set in a chilling, abandoned container yard overrun by relentless zombies. Each session throws you into an eerie industrial landscape scattered with locked containers, but only one matches the unique code you're given. Your objective is clear: hunt it down and unlock it to advance to the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with powerful weapons, including the precise M1911 and rapid-fire MAC-10, each delivering satisfying feedback with impactful visual effects and immersive sound design. Feel the intensity with every shot and elimination as you fend off waves of aggressive zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach Wave 10 and secure at least 30 kills to unlock the ultimate weapon... The Nuke. Pick it up, launch it, and celebrate a spectacular victory, bringing an explosive end to your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Container Hunt:</strong> Freshly generated codes and containers ensure random and endless replayability, ideal for speedrunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Combat:</strong> Satisfying weapon handling, impressive kill effects, and immersive audio feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Survival:</strong> Test your tactical thinking under constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environment:</strong> Detailed, atmospheric container yard designed to keep you on the edge of your seat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rare and Mysterious Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be alert! The abandoned yard holds secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you unlock the secrets and survive the CODEDOOR?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
